    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Devoted of Ynnead",
    "summary": "This rule changes how you build your army:\n\n- **YNNARI** units may be included even though they lack the **ASURYANI** Faction keyword.\n- Your **ASURYANI** units, except **EPIC HEROES**, gain the **YNNARI** keyword.\n- Your army must contain **YVRAINE**, **THE YNCARNE** or both, and 1 of them must be your **WARLORD**.",
